   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "MenuLabel",
   "szText": "\"What became of the corrupted Amazons?\"",
   "hLabel": 4215274549
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line7.1DCC9B",
   "szText": "Most of them scattered when they heard their \"prophet\" scream. We shall scour the isles to find them and bring them back to their senses, but...",
   "hLabel": 470197443
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "VoiceDir7.1DCC9B",
   "szText": "PLAYER LEAD IN LINE: \"What became of the corrupted Amazons?\"",
   "hLabel": 1815924880
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line9.1DCC9B",
   "szText": "An honorable death might be all we can give.",
   "hLabel": 4102704773
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "VoiceDir9.1DCC9B",
   "szText": "Somber. These are her former sisters that she might have to kill.",
